  "headline": "Warfarin sodium is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; on-hand supply ranges from 18.8 to 26 days across sites",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D2", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include warfarin sodium as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 272 tablets of the 6 mg presentation, providing 26 days on hand at 10.5 tablets per day.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 189 tablets of the 6 mg presentation, providing 18.8 days on hand at 10 tablets per day.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General also holds 266 tablets of the 2 mg presentation, providing 24.9 days on hand at 10.7 tablets per day.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-ranked alternate manufacturer is Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional alternate manufacturers Coupler LLC and Exelan Pharmaceuticals Inc. are similarly not on the shortage list and have no placeable plant on their labels.",
